5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited for the new season! But I really want to know where our budget actually goes. Why do we always get surprised by the final invoices?,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Budget is important, but I am more concerned about the human cost. We need to be realistic about who is actually available to execute these plans.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Budget and staff are basic. The real question is whether the public actually cares about our ""prestigious"" choices. We need to look at the actual numbers.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We are overlooking the physical reality of the gallery. If the building cannot support the exhibition, the budget and the visitors are irrelevant.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,You all make such wonderful points. I just worry about the stress on our staff when things don't arrive on time. It's so heartbreaking to apologize to guests.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, you're right about staff, but hidden costs are what kill the mood! I want to see exactly what's eating our money behind the scenes.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree, Mio, but a budget is just a number. If the people doing the work are exhausted, the exhibition will fail regardless of the funding.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, structural limits are a technicality. I'm interested in the psychological limit of our audience. Why do they stop coming back?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"It is not a technicality, Shion. It is a safety and maintenance issue. We cannot ignore the wear and tear on the main gallery's infrastructure.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with Asuka that the building matters, but I'm thinking of the paperwork. So many lovely things get stuck in customs or delayed by a signature.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,Maybe we can all look into different things? I'll focus on the money side to make sure we don't go broke this time!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,That seems fair. I will look into the actual capacity of our support systems. We cannot keep pretending we have a full house.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll take the data on the visitors. I suspect our ""perfect"" exhibitions are actually quite boring to the average person.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will investigate the structural integrity and the impact of external usage. We need to know the floor's actual limits before we commit.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the logistics then. I want to see where the delays happen so we can keep our promises to the visitors.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
